{"id":"n1-061","title":"Noun にとどまらず～も","romaji":"~ ni todomarazu ~ mo","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"This expresses the idea of 'not only...but also', 'not stopping at...'.","longExplanation":"This grammar point is used to express that something is not limited to just one thing (the thing before にとどまらず), but also includes other things (the thing after も). It can be translated as 'not only... but also...' or 'not stopping at...'.","formation":"Noun + にとどまらず + Noun + も","examples":[{"jp":"このアプリは、日本語にとどまらず、他の言語もサポートしています。","romaji":"Kono apuri wa, nihongo ni todomarazu, hoka no gengo mo sapooto shite imasu.","en":"This app not only supports Japanese, but also other languages.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"アプリ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"日本語","vocabId":"1464530","reading":"にほんご"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"とどまら","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"とどまる"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ぬ"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"他","vocabId":"1203260","reading":"た"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"言語","vocabId":"1264420","reading":"げんご"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"サポート","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7,12]},{"jp":"彼は、音楽にとどまらず、映画製作にも興味がある。","romaji":"Kare wa, ongaku ni todomarazu, eiga seisaku ni mo kyoumi ga aru.","en":"He is not only interested in music, but also in filmmaking.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"音楽","vocabId":"1183720","reading":"おんがく"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"とどまら","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"とどまる"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ぬ"},{"surface":"、","vocabI